    "warn · screen "deep" › root · Still breaks a layout rule — Level 3 (Interatividade única): the screen has no <CloseButton> or <RoundedButton> — add one and focus it. Focus starts on the rounded button (the anchored close/back control), not on the interactivity itself. The content card is focusable — the viewer moves the focus onto it from the rounded button.",
